  "statuteText": "265-A:28 License Restored Upon Proof of Financial Responsibility. –\n\nNotwithstanding the provisions of RSA 263:71, the director shall not restore a license or driving privilege to a person whose license or driving privileges have been revoked pursuant to RSA 265-A:18 until such person has furnished proof of financial responsibility as required by other provisions of the law."
